From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:50:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] codec2: drop the FDK-AAC and libaom soft codecs from the
 store list

C2PlatformComponentStore lists the soft codec libraries AOSP ships. ATL
does not ship FDK-AAC (owner licence decision N3) nor libaom (owner
decision 2026-11-07: AOM Patent License 1.0, doubtful compatibility
with the GPL-3 QEMU bridge), so libcodec2_soft_aacdec.so,
libcodec2_soft_aacenc.so and libcodec2_soft_av1enc.so (libaom's only
user) are removed from the list. AV1 decode stays (gav1, dav1d). Every
other listed library is built by ATL. ComponentModule::init keeps its
fatal dlopen check: a listed library that is missing is a build error,
not a skipped codec.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Patch-Reason: FDK-AAC and libaom are excluded by licence (owner N3, owner 2026-11-07); the list is compiled into C2Store.cpp, so only the list can drop the entries, and a stub .so would be a second implementation
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp | 5 ++---
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
index 7ca86c161f86d538feac38faf27f5ee34be635ca..c0ec896db7ab9dad476bf2c35d53c92e479de076 100644
--- a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
+++ b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
@@ -1175,8 +1175,7 @@ C2PlatformComponentStore::C2PlatformComponentStore()
     };
 
     // TODO: move this also into a .so so it can be updated
-    emplace("libcodec2_soft_aacdec.so");
-    emplace("libcodec2_soft_aacenc.so");
+    // ATL does not ship FDK-AAC (owner N3): libcodec2_soft_aacdec/aacenc are not listed
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_amrnbdec.so");
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_amrnbenc.so");
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_amrwbdec.so");
@@ -1184,7 +1183,7 @@ C2PlatformComponentStore::C2PlatformComponentStore()
     //emplace("libcodec2_soft_av1dec_aom.so"); // deprecated for the gav1 implementation
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_av1dec_gav1.so");
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_av1dec_dav1d.so");
-    emplace("libcodec2_soft_av1enc.so");
+    // ATL does not ship libaom (owner 2026-11-07): libcodec2_soft_av1enc is not listed
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_avcdec.so");
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_avcenc.so");
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_flacdec.so");
